var e=[{id:`n_1`,type:`scene_change`,speaker:null,text:null,stage:{bg:`LIFETIME`,bg_animation:null,bgm:`CUTSCENE_HOPE`,filter:`NCFT_NORMAL`,slots:{L:null,C:null,R:null}}},{id:`n_2`,type:`dialog`,speaker:`DRACO_NPC_SUMMER_NULL`,text:{KOREA:`좀만 기다려. 곧 온 바다에 내 이름이 퍼질 테니까. 그 날을 대비해서 선원 계약서도 한 장 준비해 두는 게 어때? 어차피 이제 나 없이는 못 살잖아? 캬하핫!`,JPN:`待ってろよ。もうじき全ての海にあたしの名前が広まるから。その日に備えて船員契約書も一枚用意しておけば？　どうせもうあたしなしでは生きていけないだろ？　キャハハッ！`,ENG:`You just wait. Soon, my name will spread throughout the sea. Why don't you draft up a sailor employment contract for that day? You can't live without me now, can you? Teehee!`,TWN:`等我一下！因為我的威名很快就會傳遍整個海上，在那之前你要不要也先準備個船員契約書？反正你現在沒有我就活不下去不是嗎？哇哈哈哈～～`},stage:{bg:`LIFETIME`,bg_animation:null,bgm:`CUTSCENE_HOPE`,filter:`NCFT_NORMAL`,slots:{L:null,C:{char_id:`DRACO_NPC_SUMMER_NULL`,face:`UNIT_LAUGH`,hologram:!1},R:null}}}];export{e as default};